'''Chambers of Xeric (5-Scale) Speed-Chaser''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete a [[Chambers of Xeric]] (5-scale) in under 15:00.

Like other tasks requiring a specific number of players, this combat achievement is not required for [[Group Ironman Mode|Group Ironmen]] with a smaller group size.

